      374.65,
      539.91,
      397.72
    ],
    "text": "BY Virtue of the powers vested in me by Sections 4 and 13 of the Excise Ordinance (Chapter 52), I, Ravi Karunanayake,Minister of Finance do by this Order direct that, with effect from 01.01.2016",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      80.25,
      410.65,
      505.96,
      421.72
    ],
    "text": "(1) The limit of sale of foreign liquor by retail, with respect to the whole island shall be 7.5 liters ; and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      80.25,
      434.65,
      539.7,
      457.72
    ],
    "text": "(2) The transport of maximum quantity of foreign liquor shall be 7.5 litres without a pass issued under the Ordinancewith respect to the whole island.",
